# SQL Business Analysis

## Project Overview
This project demonstrates practical SQL skills through business data analysis using SQLite.

## Tools
- SQLite
- SQL

## Skills Demonstrated
- Data filtering with WHERE
- Combining tables using JOIN
- Data aggregation with GROUP BY
- Aggregate functions (COUNT, SUM, AVG)
- Conditional analysis using CASE WHEN
- Subqueries
- Sorting and organizing query results

## Objective
To practice SQL-based data analysis and extract meaningful insights from structured business data.
